  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈、収録お疲れ様！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "015"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お疲れ様！\r\nプロデューサーさん、今日のラジオどうだったかな？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "面白かったぞ\r\nリスナーさんの反応も良かったしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、やったぁ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "放送中、ずっとタイムラインを追ってたけど\r\n『ふつおた』のコーナーが一番盛り上がってたな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "遠距離恋愛のお話だったよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈、投稿者さんの相手を想う気持ちに\r\nキュンとしちゃったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、SNSの方でも、そういう反応が多かったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "相手のことを想い続けて\r\n会えないことを我慢できるなんて、強いなぁって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "もし、自分だったらって思うと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も甘奈と甜花がしばらく離れ離れになったら\r\n大変だろうなって思ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お見通しか～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……いや、すまん \r\nふと考えてしまって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実際、どんなもんだろう\r\n何日くらいだったら耐えられそうだ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん……そうだなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "２週間くらいかな……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、確かに\r\n２週間くらいなら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、でも２日に１回は絶対に電話したい！\r\nやっぱり声は聞きたくなっちゃうもん",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、離れるなら２週間くらい、\r\nその間２日に１度は電話、か……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "短すぎかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……？　そんなことないさ \r\n一緒にいるのが当たり前の家族だもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まあ、今後は仕事によって、 \r\n長期ロケが入らないとも限らない……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、そういう時にもなるべく無理はさせたくないから\r\n……今の話を覚えておくよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがと……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020160"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ちなみに、プロデューサーさんは？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんだったらどのくらい平気？\r\n大切な人と会えない時間",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020180"
  },
  {
    "select": "１ヶ月かな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "１年くらいだな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "２週間かな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もそこまで耐えられる方じゃないと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも１ヶ月でしょ？\r\n十分長いよ～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それとも甘奈の基準が短すぎるのかなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……どうなんだろうな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "毎日会わないとダメっていう人だって\r\nいると思うし、一概には言えないと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……あんまり気にしすぎない方が良さそうだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020220,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えーっ！　そんなに～！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや……もちろん簡単に大丈夫とは言えないけど、\r\nもしどうしてもって事情があるなら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そっかぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "すごいなぁ、プロデューサーさんの強さ\r\nわけてもらいたいかも",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "無理に変えようとしなくてもいいんじゃないか\r\nそこも甘奈の個性だし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うーん……そうかなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もし大切な人との価値観の違いで困ったら\r\nその時にちゃんと話し合えばいいと思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう……だね……\r\nうん……大丈夫……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020270"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈と同じくらいだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうなんだ……\r\nちょっと意外かも……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201401202/2014012020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014012020290,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは\r\n結構平気なタイプだと思ってた",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
